# Sacha agent (Cursor — optional snippet for other workspaces)

This repo may be a design system, app, or template (e.g. ds-framework). **Project rules** belong in this repo’s own `.cursor/rules` or settings.

## sacha-agent MCP

If the `sacha-agent` MCP server is enabled (ideally **globally** in Cursor Settings → MCP — see `sacha-agent/docs/portable-setup.md`):

- Use **`search_knowledge`** for questions that need Sacha’s **indexed** notes (identity, process, how she works, DS philosophy, comms, etc.). Pass `query`; use `filter_folder` to scope (e.g. `process`, `knowledge/design-system`).
- After KB updates in `sacha-agent`, run **`reindex`**.
- Use **`list_sources`** to verify indexing.

Do **not** treat Aura or any single product name as the only context; the KB is whatever markdown exists under `sacha-agent/`.
